a2-11-wenn","level":"A2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":57,"text":"Indonesien","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":57,"text":"Indonesien","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Liebe Freunde wenn Max am Freitag wegfährt machen wir eine Feier Wenn du Zeit hast komm bitte in den Club Der Eintritt ist kostenlos wenn du diese Karte zeigst Anna backt Gebäck und wenn es dunkel wird gibt es ein Feuerwerk Wir sind aufgeregt und ein bisschen traurig weil Max so weit wegfährt Tausend Dank und alles Gute","authoredText":"Liebe Freunde, wenn Max am Freitag wegfährt, machen wir eine Feier. Wenn du Zeit hast, komm bitte in den Club. Der Eintritt ist kostenlos, wenn du diese Karte zeigst. Anna backt Gebäck, und wenn es dunkel wird, gibt es ein Feuerwerk. Wir sind aufgeregt und ein bisschen traurig, weil Max so weit wegfährt. Tausend Dank und alles Gute!","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Eine Einladung","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Wiebke, was machst du, wenn die Ferien beginnen?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_011_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Wenn ich frei habe, fahre ich immer zu meiner Familie.","speaker":"Wiebke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_011_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Und wenn es regnet?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_011_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Dann bleiben wir zu Hause und spielen Karten.","speaker":"Wiebke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_011_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Wiebke, was machst du, wenn die Ferien beginnen?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_011_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Wenn ich frei habe, fahre ich immer zu meiner Familie.","speaker":"Wiebke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_011_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Und wenn es regnet?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"A2_011_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Dann bleiben wir zu Hause und spielen Karten.","speaker":"Wiebke","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"A2_011_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Wenn ich traurig bin, rufe ich meine Schwester an.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Deine Freundin fragt: Was machst du, wenn du traurig bist?","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Wenn ich eine Einladung bekomme, schreibe ich eine Dankeskarte.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2"},{"chapter":"a2-11-wenn","level":"A2","section":"speaking","t